# WHY, measured rather than assumed (tools/adint-frame-compare, ranks 13–5117, on the
# domains BOTH walks reached). Re-measured 2026-08-19T13:19Z after the frames were rebuilt
# from the FULL ledgers; the earlier figures on this file (nl 8 admits / 3 holes, ru 6 / 1,
# union 11) were computed over a truncated schema-3 snapshot and over a shallower walk, and
# they are superseded — not contradicted. Direction held, every number moved:
#
#   nl-direct admits 13 · ru-mobile admits 14 · union 18
#
#   HOLE in an nl-direct-built frame — ru-mobile admits these, nl-direct does not:
#     #1163  rbc.ru          nl-direct says blocked           <- our blindness
#     #1169  gismeteo.ru     nl-direct says blocked           <- our blindness
#     #5117  interfax.ru     nl-direct says unreachable       <- our blindness
#     #1754  hh.ru           nl-direct says ya-generic-only   <- a DIFFERENT PAGE
#     #4583  aviasales.ru    nl-direct says no-wrapper        <- a DIFFERENT PAGE
#   HOLE in a ru-mobile-built frame — nl-direct admits these, ru-mobile does not:
#     #3128  lenta.ru        ru-mobile says ad-serving-only   <- a DIFFERENT PAGE
#     #4678  liveinternet.ru ru-mobile says unreachable       <- our blindness
#
# READ THE TWO KINDS APART. A hole whose cause is `blocked`/`unreachable` is OUR blindness at
# that moment and a later walk from the same vantage may close it; a hole whose cause is a
# named-but-different verdict is the site serving that vantage another page, and no retry
# closes it. 3 of nl-direct's 5 holes and 1 of ru-mobile's 2 are the recoverable kind, so a
# bare hole count is an upper bound on how permanent either gap is — quoting 5 against 2
# without the split overstates the difference between the vantages.
#
# NEITHER single-vantage frame is complete, and that is the standing finding. hh.ru and
# aviasales.ru are admitted only from Moscow, lenta.ru only from Amsterdam, and those three
# are CONTENT differences rather than access. The union (18 domains) is strictly better than
# either.
#
# The declaration is left at `ru-mobile` because that is the operator's instruction and it is
# still the smaller hole — 2 against 5. Switching to a union frame is a decision for the
# operator, not for whoever regenerates this file, and it carries a real cost: a union is no
# longer a rank-ordered prefix of ONE walk, so its reproduction instructions change.
#
# lenta.ru is not a flake and not a config change, and the evidence is the INTERLEAVING:
#   07:10:42Z  nl-direct  admit            hb_present=True   settle 8s
#   07:36:23Z  ru-mobile  ad-serving-only  hb_present=False  settle 45s
#   07:38:47Z  nl-direct  admit            hb_present=True   settle 45s   <- between the two
#   07:42:45Z  ru-mobile  ad-serving-only  hb_present=False  settle 45s
# An NL read sits BETWEEN two RU reads, and both re-probes used the same window. Time cannot
# explain it and neither can the window; the vantage can. (Interleave the probes whenever a
# per-vantage difference has to be told apart from a per-time one.)
#
# The asymmetry is the whole argument. A frame built from Amsterdam is a frame of "Russian
# sites Amsterdam is allowed to load", and it never says so; three of its five holes are
# outright refusals and two are worse — hh.ru and aviasales.ru are not blocked from
# Amsterdam, they serve a DIFFERENT PAGE there, one carrying no auction config. So
# vantage-dependence is not only access. A page you can load can still be the wrong page.
#
# PENDING, and it is progress rather than a defect: sportbox.ru #5813 and playground.ru #6336
# are admitted by the deeper nl-direct walk and the ru-mobile walk has not reached them yet.
# They are NOT added by hand — the frame is a rank-ordered PREFIX of the universe, and
# admitting a domain out of order would destroy the one property that makes the frame
# reproducible by a stranger. They enter when the walk arrives. (iz.ru #3322 and lenta.ru
